{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"retry","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps: my cart (three items with quantities), a shipping form (name, address, city, postcode, email, all checked, with messages under the fields), then a payment summary with a choice of standard or express delivery changing the total, and a confirmation screen with an order number. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"state step=1\nstate items=[{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Trail Runner Shoes\",\"detail\":\"Size 42\",\"price\":89,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"shoe\",\"tone\":\"sky\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Ceramic Mug\",\"detail\":\"350 ml\",\"price\":18,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"mug\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Canvas Tote\",\"detail\":\"Natural\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"tote\",\"tone\":\"mint\"}]\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"Standard\"\nstate order=\"\"\nstate tried=false\nChatCard \"Checkout\" \"Step {step} of 3\" icon:\"shopping_bag\" w:390\n  if step<4\n    Steps steps:[\"Cart\",\"Shipping\",\"Payment\"] current:=step\n  if step==1\n    SectionLabel \"Your cart\" \"{sum(items,x=>x.qty)} items\"\n    each i in items\n      CartLine \"{i.title}\" \"{i.detail}\" price:=money(i.price*i.qty,\"$\",2) qty:=i.qty kind:=i.kind tone:=i.tone -> items=updateWhere(items,x=>x.id==i.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n    TotalBar \"Subtotal\" \"Before delivery\" amount:=money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2) cta:\"Continue\" enabled:=sum(items,x=>x.qty)>0 -> step=2\n  if step==2\n    SectionLabel \"Shipping details\"\n    InputField \"Full name\" \"Ada Lovelace\" =name error:=tried&&length(trim(name))<2?\"Enter your full name\":\"\" success:=length(trim(name))>=2?\"Looks good\":\"\"\n    InputField \"Address\" \"12 Main Street\" =address error:=tried&&length(trim(address))<5?\"Enter your street address\":\"\" success:=length(trim(address))>=5?\"Looks good\":\"\"\n    InputField \"City\" \"London\" =city error:=tried&&length(trim(city))<2?\"Enter your city\":\"\" success:=length(trim(city))>=2?\"Looks good\":\"\"\n    InputField \"Postcode\" \"SW1A 1AA\" =postcode error:=tried&&length(trim(postcode))<4?\"Enter a valid postcode\":\"\" success:=length(trim(postcode))>=4?\"Looks good\":\"\"\n    InputField \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email keyboard:emailAddress error:=tried&&!(contains(email,\"@\")&&contains(email,\".\"))?\"Enter a valid email\":\"\" success:=contains(email,\"@\")&&contains(email,\".\")?\"Looks good\":\"\"\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" tone:quiet -> step=1\n      ActionButton \"Continue\" -> tried=true; step=(length(trim(name))>=2&&length(trim(address))>=5&&length(trim(city))>=2&&length(trim(postcode))>=4&&contains(email,\"@\")&&contains(email,\".\"))?3:2\n  if step==3\n    SectionLabel \"Delivery\"\n    OptionList \"Choose a delivery method\" =delivery options:[\"Standard\",\"Express\"] details:[\"3-5 days\",\"Next day\"] prices:[\"$4.99\",\"$12.99\"]\n    Details rows:=[[\"Items\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\",delivery==\"Express\"?\"$12.99\":\"$4.99\"],[\"Ship to\",name+\", \"+city],[\"Receipt to\",email]]\n    TotalBar \"Total\" \"{delivery} delivery\" amount:=money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)+(delivery==\"Express\"?12.99:4.99),\"$\",2) cta:\"Pay now\" -> order=\"ORD-\"+(100000+sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)*37+length(name)*11); step=4\n    ActionButton \"Back\" tone:quiet -> step=2\n  if step==4\n    Receipt \"Order confirmed\" \"Thanks {name}! A receipt is on its way to {email}.\" code:=order codeLabel:\"Order number\" tone:good","usage":{"input_tokens":9335,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1409,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_token